==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40~40.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,220f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 40~40.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,220f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 30.67 seconds<sup>920f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 31.33 seconds<sup>940f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*2 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 32 seconds<sup>960f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*1 [[Squire Rel]] (200%) spawns after 32.67 seconds<sup>980f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Easter Duche]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The only threats of this stage are the Easter Duches so bring a good attacker such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and a nuker if available such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

